<title>UK: Oct 16-18 Brent sold at 13 cents over November.</title>
<headline>Oct 16-18 Brent sold at 13 cents over November.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>An October 16-18 Brent crude cargo sold at 13 cents a barrel over November Brent paper on Thursday, well above the two cent premium paid for an October 17-19 cargo sold on Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>One trader said the higher premium reflected the tight October Brent supply after a number of wet trades of North Sea grades on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;There's just not a lot left,&quot; a trader said.</p>
<p>--London newsroom, +44 171 542 6280</p>
</text>
